# Rime Chill {6}{U}: "Vivid - This spell costs {1} less to cast for each color among permanents you control. Tap up to two target creatures. Put a stun
# counter on each of them. Draw a card." Bot1 controls a white Savannah Lions and a green Llanowar Elves beside colorless Moxen: two colors, so it costs {4}{U}
# and the five Moxen pay it exactly (Bot2's red Raiders does not count). It taps and stuns Bot1's own Lions and Bot2's Raiders (CR 122.1d) - the untapped Raiders ends
# tapped - and draws a card; on turn 4 Bot2's untap step spends the Raiders' stun counter instead of untapping it, while a Mox target is refused (not a creature).

